== 1. route names the runner ==
  cheap
     effort: low
     model: haiku
     agent: polaris-runner
== 2. the guard lets that agent, and only that command shape, through ==
  spawn polaris-runner, model haiku            rc 0
  runner: bg wait x --max 240                  rc 0
  runner: ls                                   rc 2
      polaris: this session is running 'claude-haiku-4-5', which is FORBIDDEN (owner, 2026-09-15) — Haiku is too weak for this work in any project. Switch with /model (Opus, Sonnet or Fable), then retry. Nothing has been read, written or run.
  general-purpose on haiku: bg wait            rc 2
      polaris: this session is running 'claude-haiku-4-5', which is FORBIDDEN (owner, 2026-09-15) — Haiku is too weak for this work in any project. Switch with /model (Opus, Sonnet or Fable), then retry. Nothing has been read, written or run.
== 3. the agent's two commands, on a green job and a red one ==
  the body names: [bash ops/polaris bg wait NAME --max 240] · [bash ops/polaris bg tail NAME -n 15]
  runner: bg wait good --max 240               rc 0
  runner: bg tail good -n 15                   rc 0
  good: rc=0
    tail: built
    tail: all green
  runner: bg wait bad --max 240                rc 0
  runner: bg tail bad -n 15                    rc 0
  bad: rc=1
    tail: built
    tail: one red
